# Levels of detail of strands (reports/content/2026-11-npc-hair/lod.md): the hero's head with strands in the sun of
# the Khorinis market, the face to the sun. Stills at 40, 70, 120, 300 and 700 cm and a clip of the camera going
# away from 40 cm to 5 m and back: the hair must look the same at every distance and must not jump as the level
# changes. Film it with OPENGOTHIC_GROOM_LOD=0 (all strands always), 0.5 (default) and 1 and compare.
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<content with the head and its strands> \
#     OPENGOTHIC_GROOM_LOD=0.5 scripts/bench.sh scripts/bench/hair-lod.bench <out>
# @timeout 300
